`PROGRESS.md` now carries the full state plus the exact next-pass plan (fetch→conform→derive→bootstrap-bgpd→SRv6-application→`CYCLES_FORCE_RERUN=1` re-run→live-window suites→evidence), with the constraint that **no Go or deploy/ edits until the running cycles job finishes** (provision rebuilds images from source mid-run).
